```pnx
word main end
```
END
  to doc
  doc page md.html or_fail
  page contents io.println
  doc to rest                                        rem the blocks, one at a time
  loop
    rest md.next or_else (e) break end to (kind, level, body, rest)
    cat (kind, " ", level, " ", body str.len) io.println
  end
end
main or_else (e) e err_text io.println end
